(* Kinetic Energy of a Planar Rigid Body: KE = 0.5 * m * \(v_G\)^2 + 0.5 * I_G *) Tj
T*
(\(omega\)^2.) Tj
T*
(- Pure Translation \(omega = 0\): KE = 0.5 * m * v_G^2.) Tj
T*
(- Pure Rotation about fixed pin O \(v_O = 0\): KE = 0.5 * I_O * omega^2.) Tj
T*
(- Rolling Without Slipping \(v_G = R*omega\): KE = 0.5 * m * \(R*omega\)^2 + 0.5 * I_G *) Tj
T*
(omega^2 = 0.5 * I_ICR * omega^2.) Tj
T*
(* Work-Energy Theorem: Sigma U_1-2 = KE_2 - KE_1.) Tj
T*
(Work of a Couple/Torque: U = Integral\( M dtheta \) = M * Delta theta \(for constant torque) Tj
T*
(M\).) Tj
