T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Angular Momentum about G: H_G = I_G * omega.) Tj
T*
(* Angular Momentum about fixed pin O: H_O = I_O * omega.) Tj
T*
(* Principle of Angular Impulse and Momentum: Integral_t1^t2\( Sigma M_G dt \) = I_G *) Tj
T*
(omega_2 - I_G * omega_1.) Tj
T*
(* Conservation of Angular Momentum: If the resultant external moment about an axis is) Tj
T*
(zero \(Sigma M_ext = 0\), total angular momentum about that axis is conserved: I_1 *) Tj
T*
(omega_1 = I_2 * omega_2.) Tj
